      "content": "{\"legal_evidence\": {\"current_date\": \"2024-11-05\", \"current_prefix\": [{\"id\": \"C:T000\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Hey, are you there?\"}, {\"id\": \"C:T001\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"Hi John, yes, I'm here. How are things going?\"}, {\"id\": \"C:T002\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Honestly, things have been a bit tough lately.\"}], \"legal_past_sessions\": [{\"id\": \"H001\", \"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"turns\": [{\"id\": \"H001:T000\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"Hello, how are you feeling today?\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T001\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"i feel upset today\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T002\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"I'm so sorry to hear that. Is there any particular reason you feel upset today?\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T003\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"yes.i have sleeping problem\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T004\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"That's really hard, but I'm sure we can find a way to make your sleeping more at ease. Has it been happening frequently? \"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T005\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"yes.the problem occurs me daily night\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T006\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"I had a problem sleeping before, is it ok if I give you some suggestions that helped me and might help you too?\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T007\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"yes.sure i am ready to get suggetions from you\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T008\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"Try practicing meditation and yoga, and avoid mobile phones atleast an hour before you sleep. Chamomile tea also helped me relaxed before. \"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T009\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"ok.its very good advice .i will follow these steps surely\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T010\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"That's wonderful that you're very open, I'm sure you will be well in no time. If you still have a hard time sleeping, feel free to contact us again. We'll be happy to help.\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T011\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"ya.sure.thanks you very much for the help\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T012\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"You're welcome! Have a nice day.\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T013\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"thank you so much .have a nice day\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T014\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"Stay safe and try doing naps first.\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T015\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"i decided to to yoga for better sleep\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T016\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"that's wonderful. how did it go?\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T017\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"its nice and going good\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T018\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"That's wonderful. I also kept on doing yoga.\"}, {\"id\": \"H001:T019\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"ok.thank you.all the best too\"}]}, {\"id\": \"H002\", \"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"turns\": [{\"id\": \"H002:T000\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"Hi! Hope you are doing well?\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T001\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Hi, yes am doing well\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T002\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"Glad to know that you are doing well. How may I assist you today ?\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T003\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"I had a drinking challenge which has been affecting my marriage for quit sometime now\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T004\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"So as far as I understand that you had issues with your wife due to your drinking. Am I right?\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T005\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Yes that is true\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T006\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"That is really a serious problem. I know it must be very tough time for you. Hope you are trying your best to save your marriage.\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T007\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Yes I have really reduced my drinking to ensure I save my marriage\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T008\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"That's is a great initiative. I know it is tough for you but not impossible. I can feel how hard you are trying t save your relationship. I appreciate you for that.\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T009\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Thank you for the encouragement. Will do everything I can to save the situation\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T010\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"Family comes first. I would do anything to save my marriage as you are doing. I am proud of you. I am pretty sure you both love each other more than anything.\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T011\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Yes my wife is everything to me and can not imagine loosing her due to some avoidable reasons\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T012\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"That should be the spirit. Now nothing can make you apart. Drinking is very easy for you to quit now. you will definitely get a success.\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T013\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Thank you\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T014\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"No problem! That's why I am here to help you. Have a wonderful life ahead!\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T015\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Any other general advice you may have for me\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T016\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"Just stick to the plan. Spend more time together. Cook dinner for her. Make a strong bond and my best wishes are there for you .\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T017\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Wow that is some wonderful advice right there. thank you for that..Any other tips to spice things up\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T018\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"You both can go for a date or do the things what your partner like. Drinking is luring so stay away from that and you can do it.\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T019\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Thank you I will definitely avoid drinking and any thing else that may contribute to such kind of issues\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T020\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"It seems you got the solution. have a wonderful time.\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T021\", \"role\": \"seeker\", \"text\": \"Thank you for the assistance. Really appreciates\"}, {\"id\": \"H002:T022\", \"role\": \"supporter\", \"text\": \"your most welcome!\"}]}]}, \"reply\": \"You can take your time. Would you like to tell me more about what has been tough?\", \"response_units\": [{\"id\": \"R001\", \"text\": \"You can take your time.\"}, {\"id\": \"R002\", \"text\": \"Would you like to tell me more about what has been tough?\"}]}"
    }
